  "description": "From afar, it looks like Seren Lubave's set for a fairytale ending. Not only was she saved by the emperor from certain death, but it turns out she’s also his fated partner, the only one who can suppress his dragon blood. But Seren never asked for this, and now she can’t shake off the sense that something’s wrong. What is the emperor keeping from her, and why can’t she remember the attack that brought her here in the first place? She's about to discover fairytales should never be built on lies...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
